  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 3013
    m_Localized: Every 2 seconds, restores {Value} energy to allied non-building
      units within a radius of {Radius} (downed characters included).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3014
    m_Localized: Every 2 seconds, its owner gains {Value} Mora.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3015
    m_Localized: Starts with {InitEnergy} energy and gains {Value} more every 2 seconds.
      Whenever its energy reaches {Threshold} or above, immediately summons 1 {SummonUnit},
      consuming {Threshold} energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3016
    m_Localized: Every 2 seconds, heals allied living units below {Threshold}% HP
      for an amount equal to {Value}% of this building's ATK.
